This project's research direction was inspired in part by work such as
OmniScientist and the broader movement toward omni-modal scientific reasoning.
EIF is an independent framework and contains no OmniScientist code, nor does it
depend on OmniScientist at runtime.

All example and benchmark data included in this repository is synthetic and is
labeled as such.
